{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EJzv0LQg4Q1795246307.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[17:22更新]</p><p>秘魯中部發生6.7級地震，首都利馬有強烈震感，暫時未有傷亡報告。</p><p></p><p>地震發生時，利馬有閉路電視鏡頭不斷震動。當地電視台報道，部分民眾走到戶外暫避。</p><p></p><p>地震在當地周五晚上7時09分發生，震央位於胡寧省胡寧市西北部30公里，震源深度約129公里。新華社引述秘魯地球物理研究所測定，利馬等震感強烈。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PERU.QUAKE-1500.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JtEJ0TUUtX1795246318.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>[08:32]</p><p>秘魯發生6.7級地震，首都利馬震感強烈。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:23:53.257737+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T10:57:14.810406+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:17.059400+00:00","content_hash":"d7fc172b303d9e486e624486c8eaaa524d033209eee759d3f58a68a1de9a38f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:23:53.257737+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}